  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道你是个\n厉害的宝可梦训练家。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590534F60662F4E2A000A53895BB376845B9D53EF68A68BAD7EC35BB6300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要打赢你就得针对一点进行突破！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我要用自己深爱的属性，\n也就是虫属性的宝可梦们进行攻击！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898162538D624F605C315F9794885BF94E0070B98FDB884C7A817834FF0100100001BE01000A62118981752881EA5DF16DF1723176845C5E6027FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F866B5C5E602776845B9D53EF68A64EEC8FDB884C653B51FBFF0100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有爱的地方就会诞生智谋，\n而智谋会孕育出强大的实力！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来吧！和我一决胜负！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670972317684573065B95C314F1A8BDE751F667A8C0BFF0C000A800C667A8C0B4F1A5B5580B251FA5F3A592776845B9E529BFF0100100001BE00000A67655427FF01548C62114E0051B380DC8D1FFF0100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意和我对战的话，\n就做好觉悟来找我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F548C62115BF9621876848BDDFF0C000A5C31505A597D89C9609F6765627E62115427FF0100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来吧！请和我的\n虫属性宝可梦们一决胜负。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655427FF018BF7548C62117684000A866B5C5E60275B9D53EF68A64EEC4E0051B380DC8D1F300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一决胜负！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0051B380DC8D1FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么？火、岩石和飞行属性\n明明都是虫属性的弱点啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48FF1F706B30015CA977F3548C98DE884C5C5E6027000A660E660E90FD662F866B5C5E602776845F3170B9554A300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我喜欢虫属性的宝可梦，\n要激发它们的潜力，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我可是要用超级进化的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211559C6B22866B5C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A89816FC053D15B834EEC76846F5C529BFF0C00100001BE00000A621153EF662F898175288D857EA78FDB53167684FF0100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超级进化的凯罗斯，\n还有其它孩子们都辛苦了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857EA78FDB5316768451EF7F5765AFFF0C000A8FD8670951765B835B695B504EEC90FD8F9B82E64E86300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说回来，超级进化的行家\n真是越来越多了啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF456DE6765FF0C8D857EA78FDB53167684884C5BB6000A771F662F8D8A67658D8A591A4E86554A300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有个传言说，阔星公司\n能开发超级环了，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n背后有个叫做AZ的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E2A4F208A008BF4FF0C9614661F516C53F8000A80FD5F0053D18D857EA773AF4E86FF0C00100001BE00000A80CC540E67094E2A53EB505A0041005A76844EBA300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96837554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真厉害啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53895BB3554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且据说AZ这个人\n曾在遥远的丰缘地区<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n得知并独自调查了可以称为\n超级进化起源的现象。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14636E8BF40041005A8FD94E2A4EBA000A66FE572890658FDC76844E307F185730533A00100001BE01000A5F9777E55E7672EC81EA8C0367E54E8653EF4EE579F04E3A000A8D857EA78FDB53168D776E90768473B08C61300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说他把那个调查结果\n分享给阔星公司了。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n他究竟有什么打算呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF44ED6628A90A34E2A8C0367E57ED3679C000A52064EAB7ED99614661F516C53F84E86300200100001BE00000A4ED67A767ADF67094EC04E4862537B975462FF1F00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，如果能让心爱的\n宝可梦超级进化，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我会感到非常非常非常满足的哦！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n让我们彼此都珍惜超级进化吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C5982679C80FD8BA95FC372317684000A5B9D53EF68A68D857EA78FDB5316FF0C00100001BE00000A62114F1A611F5230975E5E38975E5E38975E5E386EE18DB3768454E6FF0100100001BE01000A8BA962114EEC5F7C6B6490FD73CD60DC8D857EA78FDB53165427300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
